[ar:London Philharmonic Orchestra, David Parry, London Philharmonic Choir & The London Chorus]
[al:The 50 Greatest Pieces of Classical Music]
[ti:Carmina Burana: O Fortuna]
[00:02.21] O fortuna
[00:08.94] Velut luna
[00:15.60] Statu variabilis
[00:27.14] Semper crescis
[00:29.62] Aut decrescis
[00:32.37] Vita detestabilis
[00:37.41] Nunc obdurat
[00:40.13] Et tunc curat
[00:42.52] Ludo mentis aciem
[00:48.13] Egestatem
[00:50.41] Potestatem
[00:53.24] Dissolvit ut glaciem
[00:58.58] Sors immanis
[01:01.30] Et inanis
[01:03.68] Rota tu volubilis
[01:09.28] Status malus
[01:11.65] Vana salus
[01:14.44] Semper dissolubilis
[01:19.60] Obumbrata
[01:22.44] Et velata
[01:24.71] Michi quoque niteris
[01:30.49] Nunc per ludum
[01:32.95] Dorsum nudum
[01:35.52] Fero tui sceleris
[01:40.82] Sors salutis
[01:43.54] Et virtutis
[01:46.08] Michi nunc contraria
[01:51.24] Est affectus
[01:53.88] Et defectus
[01:56.64] Semper in angaria
[02:01.74] Hac in hora
[02:04.69] Sine mora
[02:06.79] Corde pulsum tangite
[02:12.45] Quod per sortem
[02:15.04] Sternit fortem
[02:17.81] Mecum omnes plangite
[02:36.03] 
